      "text": "Comedy (drama)\nA comedy of manners typically takes as its subject a particular part of society ( usually upper class society ) and uses humor to parody or satirize the behavior and mannerisms of its members . Romantic comedy is a popular genre that depicts burgeoning romance in humorous terms , and focuses on the foibles of those who are falling in love ."
